  "why": {
    "tokens": [
      {
        "t": "text",
        "v": "A kit is a phantom item with a bill of material. The production bill of material is what kit handling reads to put the components on the sales order. A job shop bill of material, generated from it for a site, is what costing reads. So a kit needs both, and the standard cost comes last."
      }
    ],
